<title>JAPAN: Tochigi Fuji - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tochigi Fuji - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.40		vs	   15.02</p>
<p> Operating	  413    million	  vs	  504    million</p>
<p> Current	    655    million	  vs	  688    million</p>
